{"id":"10d54928fc77535a","group":"58","path":"58/batch12/58-df-central-simple-algebra.md","title":"Central Simple Algebra","display":"df-central-simple-algebra — Central Simple Algebra","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-central-simple-algebra","aliases":["58-df-central-simple-algebra","Central Simple Algebra"],"display":"df-central-simple-algebra — Central Simple Algebra","depends_on":["[[58-df-simple-algebra]]","[[58-df-algebra]]","[[58-df-field]]","[[58-df-function]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-central-simple-algebra"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-central-simple-algebra</span><span>Central Simple Algebra</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-central-simple-algebra — Central Simple Algebra"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a627a5785ab31788\" href=\"?note=a627a5785ab31788\" title=\"58-df-simple-algebra\">58-df-simple-algebra</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"573b416d39297a97\" href=\"?note=573b416d39297a97\" title=\"58-df-algebra\">58-df-algebra</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"1eb4a89b005d9cda\" href=\"?note=1eb4a89b005d9cda\" title=\"58-df-field\">58-df-field</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,k,+_A,\\cdot_A,0_A,1_A,+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k,\\odot_A,\\iota\\in V\">\\(A,k,+_A,\\cdot_A,0_A,1_A,+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k,\\odot_A,\\iota\\in V\\)</span> (explicit algebra, field, scalar-action, and scalar-embedding data)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Z(A)=\\{z\\in A:\\forall a\\in A\\;(z\\cdot_Aa=a\\cdot_Az)\\}\">\\(Z(A)=\\{z\\in A:\\forall a\\in A\\;(z\\cdot_Aa=a\\cdot_Az)\\}\\)</span> (center)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Alg}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Alg}_S\\)</span> (algebra predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"573b416d39297a97\" href=\"?note=573b416d39297a97\" title=\"58-df-algebra\">58-df-algebra</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Field}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Field}_S\\)</span> (field predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"1eb4a89b005d9cda\" href=\"?note=1eb4a89b005d9cda\" title=\"58-df-field\">58-df-field</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SimpleAlgebra}_S\">\\(\\operatorname{SimpleAlgebra}_S\\)</span> (simple-algebra predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"a627a5785ab31788\" href=\"?note=a627a5785ab31788\" title=\"58-df-simple-algebra\">58-df-simple-algebra</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CentralSimpleAlgebraStructure}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{CentralSimpleAlgebraStructure}_S\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CentralSimpleAlgebra}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{CentralSimpleAlgebra}_S\\)</span> (explicit structure predicate and carrier-level compatibility projection)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}central-simple-algebra\\text{-}explicit} \\vdash \\mathrm{CentralSimpleAlgebraStructure}_S(A,k,+_A,\\cdot_A,0_A,1_A,+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k,\\odot_A,\\iota)\\leftrightarrow\\left[\\begin{aligned}&amp;\\mathrm{Field}_S(k,+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k)\\land\\mathrm{Alg}_S(k,A,+_A,\\cdot_A)\\land\\operatorname{VectorSpace}_k(A,+_A,\\odot_A)\\\\&amp;\\land0_A,1_A\\in A\\land\\forall a\\in A\\;(0_A+_Aa=a=a+_A0_A\\land1_A\\cdot_Aa=a=a\\cdot_A1_A)\\\\&amp;\\land\\dim_{k,\\odot_A}(A)&lt;\\omega\\land\\operatorname{SimpleAlgebra}_S(A,k,+_A,\\cdot_A,0_A)\\land\\iota:k\\to A\\\\&amp;\\land\\iota(0_k)=0_A\\land\\iota(1_k)=1_A\\land\\forall\\lambda,\\mu\\in k\\;\\bigl(\\iota(\\lambda+_k\\mu)=\\iota(\\lambda)+_A\\iota(\\mu)\\land\\iota(\\lambda\\cdot_k\\mu)=\\iota(\\lambda)\\cdot_A\\iota(\\mu)\\bigr)\\\\&amp;\\land\\forall\\lambda\\in k\\;\\forall a\\in A\\;(\\lambda\\odot_Aa=\\iota(\\lambda)\\cdot_Aa)\\land\\{z\\in A:\\forall a\\in A\\;(z\\cdot_Aa=a\\cdot_Az)\\}=\\operatorname{ran}(\\iota)\\end{aligned}\\right]\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}central-simple-algebra\\text{-}explicit} \\vdash \\mathrm{CentralSimpleAlgebraStructure}_S(A,k,+_A,\\cdot_A,0_A,1_A,+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k,\\odot_A,\\iota)\\leftrightarrow\\left[\\begin{aligned}&amp;\\mathrm{Field}_S(k,+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k)\\land\\mathrm{Alg}_S(k,A,+_A,\\cdot_A)\\land\\operatorname{VectorSpace}_k(A,+_A,\\odot_A)\\\\&amp;\\land0_A,1_A\\in A\\land\\forall a\\in A\\;(0_A+_Aa=a=a+_A0_A\\land1_A\\cdot_Aa=a=a\\cdot_A1_A)\\\\&amp;\\land\\dim_{k,\\odot_A}(A)&lt;\\omega\\land\\operatorname{SimpleAlgebra}_S(A,k,+_A,\\cdot_A,0_A)\\land\\iota:k\\to A\\\\&amp;\\land\\iota(0_k)=0_A\\land\\iota(1_k)=1_A\\land\\forall\\lambda,\\mu\\in k\\;\\bigl(\\iota(\\lambda+_k\\mu)=\\iota(\\lambda)+_A\\iota(\\mu)\\land\\iota(\\lambda\\cdot_k\\mu)=\\iota(\\lambda)\\cdot_A\\iota(\\mu)\\bigr)\\\\&amp;\\land\\forall\\lambda\\in k\\;\\forall a\\in A\\;(\\lambda\\odot_Aa=\\iota(\\lambda)\\cdot_Aa)\\land\\{z\\in A:\\forall a\\in A\\;(z\\cdot_Aa=a\\cdot_Az)\\}=\\operatorname{ran}(\\iota)\\end{aligned}\\right]\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}central-simple-algebra\\text{-}projection} \\vdash \\mathrm{CentralSimpleAlgebra}_S(A,k)\\leftrightarrow\\exists +_A,\\cdot_A,0_A,1_A,+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k,\\odot_A,\\iota\\in V\\;\\mathrm{CentralSimpleAlgebraStructure}_S(A,k,+_A,\\cdot_A,0_A,1_A,+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k,\\odot_A,\\iota)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}central-simple-algebra\\text{-}projection} \\vdash \\mathrm{CentralSimpleAlgebra}_S(A,k)\\leftrightarrow\\exists +_A,\\cdot_A,0_A,1_A,+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k,\\odot_A,\\iota\\in V\\;\\mathrm{CentralSimpleAlgebraStructure}_S(A,k,+_A,\\cdot_A,0_A,1_A,+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k,\\odot_A,\\iota)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The explicit predicate carries every operation used by simplicity, finite dimension, and the central scalar embedding; the two-argument form existentially projects this structure for downstream compatibility.</li>\n<li>Central simple algebra (CSA): simple + center = the embedded copy of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\">\\(k\\)</span>; classified by Brauer group</li>\n<li>Tensor product of CSA is CSA; Brauer group is group under <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\otimes\">\\(\\otimes\\)</span></li>\n<li>Examples: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M_n(k)\">\\(M_n(k)\\)</span>, Hamilton's quaternions <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb{H}\">\\(\\mathbb{H}\\)</span>, division algebras</li>\n<li>Splitting: CSA splits over extension <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K/k \\iff\">\\(K/k \\iff\\)</span> becomes matrix algebra over <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K\">\\(K\\)</span></li>\n<li>Wedderburn and Brauer group statements are downstream theorems, not part of this definition atom.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Jacobson, Basic Algebra II</li>\n<li>Gille and Szamie, Central Simple Algebras</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"5